3b.mp3"}},{"text":"정도면","meaning":"程度，限度","explanation":"정도：程度，限度；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"정도","audio":"/audio/1a771e4b7f99176bc0a6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70876","senseId":"2","lemma":"정도","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"정도면","audio":"/audio/c593aac23c78f4332848.mp3"}},{"text":"표준이지.","meaning":"标准","explanation":"표준：标准；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"표준","audio":"/audio/54af05f0bfc70fc98db6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84205","senseId":"2","lemma":"표준","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"표준이지","audio":"/audio/29bae496e85bd5ef9ca0.mp3"}},{"text":"너무","meaning":"太","explanation":"너무：太","readings":[{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28183","senseId":"1","lemma":"너무","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}},{"text":"걱정하지","meaning":"担心，忧虑，担忧","explanation":"걱정하다：担心，忧虑，担忧；지：连接后续表达，可形成对照；与 않다、못하다、말다 等合用时表示否定、不能或禁止。","readings":[{"term":"걱정하다","audio":"/audio/1c0536edd039d6aa03ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60091","senseId":"1","lemma":"걱정하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"걱정하지","audio":"/audio/bd0a4ac52682c7b2451f.mp3"}},{"text":"마.","meaning":"不要做、停止做（-지 말다）","explanation":"말다：不要做、停止做（-지 말다）；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"말다","audio":"/audio/f8b54c8d9bfb2043a3b8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69296","senseId":"2","lemma":"말다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"마","audio":"/audio/0a8a81fee098641dbae5.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"1a771e4b7f99176b","term":"정도","zh":"程度，限度","audio":"/audio/1a771e4b7f99176bc0a6.mp3","entryId":"70876","definition":"不能超过的一定水准；或指适当的限度。",